{"2598980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oh Baby Kart", "steam_appid": 2598980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/702f744d251d916a158d046e0e69e44d.poster.avif?t=1776644780\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/702f744d251d916a158d046e0e69e44d.webm?t=1776644780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/702f744d251d916a158d046e0e69e44d.mp4?t=1776644780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh Baby! It's time for racing! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>OH BABY! KART</strong>, racing like you have never seen before! Innovative drift boost and ultimate abilities! Select your driver, customize your kart and get ready to race!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drifting Ultimate Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/d5b013c371693af41e63528c3398379c.poster.avif?t=1776644780\" width=616 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/d5b013c371693af41e63528c3398379c.webm?t=1776644780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/d5b013c371693af41e63528c3398379c.mp4?t=1776644780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Drifting gives you powers, ULTIMATE powers! Speed boost? Rockets? Freezing bams and booms? Pick your style and play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect them all? Collect them all!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/f37d57c39a460830e62432570b8a28ee.poster.avif?t=1776644780\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/f37d57c39a460830e62432570b8a28ee.webm?t=1776644780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/f37d57c39a460830e62432570b8a28ee.mp4?t=1776644780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Whales, Butters and fast cars! There's karts for everyone! Decorate them with ornaments to show off your achievements or plain &quot;whaat?&quot;, we got chopsticks, umbrellas or even pets for those long rides! The possibilities are endless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTENSE MULTIPLAYER ACTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/6f87e0dbd97808ff5b3b686d63ab95b4.poster.avif?t=1776644780\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/6f87e0dbd97808ff5b3b686d63ab95b4.webm?t=1776644780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/6f87e0dbd97808ff5b3b686d63ab95b4.mp4?t=1776644780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Go against competitors all over the world! Party up or go solo and get that position on the global leaderboards! More into fun play? Setup a custom lobby with your friends! You can show your mastery of the tracks or how you use your ultimates everywhere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHALLENGE MODE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/5cf362cc763c559b7c83d05ebc696a3c.avif?t=1776644780\" width=609 height=153 /></span>We got more! Go on the adventure maps! A fusion of skill-based trials, daring obstacle courses and unique competitive scenarios you can put your skills to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/04f42029a19372491cfad4db2ba26bf2.poster.avif?t=1776644780\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/04f42029a19372491cfad4db2ba26bf2.webm?t=1776644780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/04f42029a19372491cfad4db2ba26bf2.mp4?t=1776644780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh Baby!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh Baby! It's time for racing! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>OH BABY! KART</strong>, racing like you have never seen before! Innovative drift boost and ultimate abilities! Select your driver, customize your kart and get ready to race!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drifting Ultimate Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/d5b013c371693af41e63528c3398379c.poster.avif?t=1776644780\" width=616 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598980/extras/d5b013c371693af41e63528c3398379c.webm?t=1776644780\" type=\"video/webm; c